# Licensed and proprietary assets — deliberately untracked while this repo is
# PUBLIC. public/fonts is the real licensed ABC ROM that globals.css serves
# @font-face from, docs/brand holds the brand asset archive, and .cursor/rules
# holds internal brand/design/content guidance. Ignored rather than merely
# untracked so a `git add -A` can't publish them by accident.
#
# If the repo becomes private, these can be tracked — delete these lines and
# commit them. Note the cost of leaving them out: a fresh clone renders in the
# fallback font stack, not the real type.
public/
docs/
.cursor/
zz1/
